{"facts":[{"id":"K1","verdict":"right","where":["file_dispute","decide_parameters","incorrect_amount_branch","deposit_compare"],"evidence":"for incorrect_amount, the confirmed difference; for an ATM cash discrepancy, the recorded withdrawal minus the cash received; for atm_deposit_not_credited, deposited minus credited","why":"The file_dispute argument sets the overcharge, cash not received, amount not credited, and whole charge for the other categories."},{"id":"K2","verdict":"partly","where":["liability_disclosure","late_report_liability","file_dispute"],"evidence":"the doc 031 tier counted from the statement: the lesser of $50 and the amount, the lesser of $500 and the amount, or -1","why":"The tier is counted from the statement, but 'the amount' could be read as the transaction amount rather than the disputed amount, and no value is given when the tier cannot be settled."},{"id":"K3","verdict":"partly","where":["gather_details","type_from_customer_report","rules"],"evidence":"set transaction_type from what they report together with the transaction description. If nothing indicates the type, ask once more. Do not guess.","why":"The job maps most types and asks when the type is unknown, but it never names online_purchase as the value for online or phone purchases."},{"id":"K4","verdict":"right","where":["decide_provisional_credit","rho_atm_confirmed_provisional"],"evidence":"Set provisional_credit_eligible true only if all four conditions hold and no NOT REQUIRED item applies; otherwise false.","why":"The four conditions and the category list exclude the four non-credit categories, and pin_compromised yes_shared makes it false."},{"id":"K5","verdict":"right","where":["decide_parameters","rules"],"evidence":"card_present_fraud or card_not_present_fraud → close_and_reissue; unauthorized_transaction → freeze_pending_investigation; all others → keep_active.","why":"Each dispute records its own category's mapping."},{"id":"K6","verdict":"right","where":["pin_compromised_unsure","gather_details","rules"],"evidence":"shared it → yes_shared; observed or skimmed → yes_observed; not compromised → no; really does not know → unknown.","why":"The job maps all four answers explicitly."},{"id":"K7","verdict":"right","where":["gather_details","incorrect_amount_branch","goods_not_received_branch","recurring_charge_branch"],"evidence":"merchant contact (non-fraud disputes)... contacted_merchant as the customer says.","why":"The job asks about merchant contact for non-fraud disputes and passes the customer's answer."},{"id":"K8","verdict":"right","where":["in_person_fraud_with_card_held","choose_category"],"evidence":"For an in-store purchase the customer did not make, with fraud suspected while they still hold the card... card_present_fraud","why":"The job explicitly handles a held, cloned card as card_present_fraud and reserves card_not_present_fraud for online or phone."},{"id":"K9","verdict":"right","where":["starts","pick_earliest_duplicate","from_pin_lock_handoff","pin_lock_each_withdrawal"],"evidence":"File one dispute per transaction... Dispute only the ones they deny.","why":"The job files one dispute per transaction_id, the earliest for duplicates, and only for transactions the customer denies."}],
"traps":[{"id":"T1","present":false,"where":[],"evidence":""},{"id":"T2","present":false,"where":[],"evidence":""},{"id":"T3","present":false,"where":[],"evidence":""},{"id":"T4","present":true,"where":["amount_differs_from_record"],"evidence":"If a matched transaction's recorded amount differs from what the customer said... ask whether they still want to dispute it... No: do not file it"},{"id":"T5","present":false,"where":[],"evidence":""}],
"conflicts":[{"case":"Rho-Bank ATM deposit where the credited amount differs from what the customer says they deposited","where":["amount_differs_from_record","deposit_compare"],"why":"amount_differs_from_record excludes only ATM cash discrepancies, so for a deposit it offers to drop the dispute or use the recorded amount, while deposit_compare files deposited minus credited."},{"case":"Third-party ATM cash discrepancy where the recorded amount differs from the customer's figure","where":["amount_differs_from_record","decide_parameters"],"why":"amount_differs_from_record says to use the whole recorded charge, while decide_parameters sets the recorded withdrawal minus the cash received."},{"case":"Unvalidated Rho-Bank ATM claim the customer still files","where":["rho_atm_not_validated","file_dispute"],"why":"rho_atm_not_validated uses the amount requested minus the cash received, while the file_dispute argument says the recorded withdrawal minus the cash received, which equals zero."},{"case":"Liability tier that cannot be settled","where":["late_report_liability","file_dispute"],"why":"late_report_liability says not to pick a tier, while file_dispute requires a single customer_max_liability_amount."}]}
